  "talents_description": {
    "modifier_windranger_1_0": "Strength: 5/10/15",
    "modifier_windranger_1_1": "Strength: <b><font color='#eabe10'>5</font></b>/10/15",
    "modifier_windranger_1_2": "Strength: 5/<b><font color='#eabe10'>10</font></b>/15",
    "modifier_windranger_1_3": "Strength: 5/10/<b><font color='#eabe10'>15</font></b>",
    "modifier_windranger_2_0": "Cooldown Reduction for Focus Fire and Whirlwind: 5/10 sec.",
    "modifier_windranger_2_1": "Cooldown Reduction for Focus Fire and Whirlwind: <b><font color='#eabe10'>5</font></b>/10 sec.",
    "modifier_windranger_2_2": "Cooldown Reduction for Focus Fire and Whirlwind: 5/<b><font color='#eabe10'>10</font></b> sec.",
    "modifier_windranger_3_0": "New Active Ability: Gale Force \n\n Summons a powerful blast of wind that pushes all enemies in the area of effect in the selected direction. Vector application. \n\n Wind Speed: 120 \n Duration: 3 seconds",
    "modifier_windranger_3_1": "New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Gale Force</font></b> \n\n Summons a powerful blast of wind that pushes all enemies in the area of effect in the selected direction. Vector application. \n\n Wind Speed: <b><font color='#eabe10'>120</font></b> \n Duration: 3 seconds",
    "modifier_windranger_4_0": "Gale Force deals Magic Damage per Second: 50%/100% of Strength",
    "modifier_windranger_4_1": "Gale Force deals Magic Damage per Second: <b><font color='#eabe10'>50%</font></b>/100% of Strength",
    "modifier_windranger_4_2": "Gale Force deals Magic Damage per Second: 50%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>100%</font></b> of Strength",
    "modifier_windranger_5_0": "Attack Range: 300",
    "modifier_windranger_5_1": "Attack Range: <b><font color='#eabe10'>300</font></b>",
    "modifier_windranger_6_0": "Gale Force Duration Increase: 3/6/9 seconds",
    "modifier_windranger_6_1": "Gale Force Duration Increase: <b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b>/6/9 seconds",
    "modifier_windranger_6_2": "Gale Force Duration Increase: 3/<b><font color='#eabe10'>6</font></b>/9 seconds",
    "modifier_windranger_6_3": "Gale Force Duration Increase: 3/6/<b><font color='#eabe10'>9</font></b> seconds",
    "modifier_windranger_7_0": "New Active Ability: Whirlwind \n\n The hero performs a fixed number of attacks each second on random enemies within attack range (prioritizing heroes). The same enemy can only be targeted every 4 attacks. Shares level and cooldown with Focus Fire. \n\n Attacks per Second: 11 \n Duration: 8 sec.",
    "modifier_windranger_7_1": "New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Whirlwind</font></b> \n\n The hero performs a fixed number of attacks each second on random enemies within attack range (prioritizing heroes). The same enemy can only be targeted every <b><font color='#eabe10'>4</font></b> attacks. Shares level and cooldown with Focus Fire. \n\n Attacks per Second: <b><font color='#eabe10'>11</font></b> \n Duration: 8 sec.",
    "modifier_windranger_8_0": "Reduced Damage Penalty of Focus Fire and Whirlwind: 5%/10%",
    "modifier_windranger_8_1": "Reduced Damage Penalty of Focus Fire and Whirlwind: <b><font color='#eabe10'>5%</font></b>/10%",
    "modifier_windranger_8_2": "Reduced Damage Penalty of Focus Fire and Whirlwind: 5%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>10%</font></b>",
    "modifier_windranger_9_0": "At the start of Windrun, a Tornado is created. \n\n Tornado deals physical damage to enemies every second. \n\n Damage: 75 \n Radius: 400 \n Duration: 4 sec.",
    "modifier_windranger_9_1": "At the start of Windrun, a Tornado is created. \n\n Tornado deals physical damage to enemies every second. \n\n Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>75</font></b> \n Radius: 400 \n Duration: 4 sec.",
    "modifier_windranger_10_0": "Tornado Damage Increase: 60%/90%/120% of Agility",
